Provenance & attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Earshot is an independent, from-scratch implementation. Its purpose and problem
space were inspired by prior FreeSWITCH audio-streaming modules, and we credit
them gratefully:

  * amigniter/mod_audio_stream  — https://github.com/amigniter/mod_audio_stream
    MIT License. The original community module for streaming FreeSWITCH channel
    audio to a WebSocket with bidirectional playback. Earshot reimagines the API
    and adds codecs, protocol adapters, correlation, barge-in, and metrics; it
    does not copy that project's source.

  * drachtio/freeswitch-modules (mod_audio_fork / mod_audio_stream), Dave Horton
    MIT License. Referenced for design comparison.

If any third-party source is later vendored into this repository, its original
